WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.800
Reflex routes only small high resolution crops to heavy vision. Full frames are never sent. Fast detectors propose boxes, a cheap relevance filter scores them, and only the top crops travel onward as crop packets. What you see here is illustrated and vision fenced. Ladders describe direction, not delivered capability. Latency figures are hypotheses to measure, not measurements.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:50.124
One chip on this page is real. The privacy redactor test suite passes fourteen tests plus eleven subtests: genuine replay, not illustration. Passwords, emails, and card numbers are redacted before anything else runs. Try it yourself. Run the redactor tests, start the console offline in mock demo mode, and read the ambition document for the full ladder.
